{
  "type": "html",
  "title": "进程状态转换图示",
  "html_content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>body{margin:20px;font-family:Arial}.container{max-width:800px;margin:auto}canvas{border:1px solid #ccc}#states{display:flex;gap:10px;margin:20px 0}.state{padding:10px;border-radius:5px;text-align:center}.active{background:#e6f7ff}</style></head><body><div class='container'><h2>进程状态转换</h2><canvas id='c' width='700' height='400'></canvas><div id='states'></div><button onclick='startDemo()'>开始演示</button></div><script>const c=document.getElementById('c');const ctx=c.getContext('2d');const states=['创建','就绪','执行','阻塞','终止'];const colors=['#ff9999','#99ccff','#99ff99','#ffff99','#ffcc99'];let currentState=0;function draw(){ctx.clearRect(0,0,c.width,c.height);for(let i=0;i<states.length;i++){const x=100+i*120;drawCircle(x,200,30,colors[i],states[i]);if(currentState===i){fillText(states[i]+': 已选中',x-40,260)}else{fillText(states[i],x-40,260)}}drawArrows();}function drawCircle(x,y,r,col,txt){ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(x,y,r,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fillStyle=col;ctx.fill();ctx.strokeStyle='#333';ctx.stroke();ctx.fillStyle='white';ctx.font='bold 16px Arial';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.fillText(txt,x,y+5);}function fillText(t,x,y){ctx.fillStyle='black';ctx.font='14px Arial';ctx.fillText(t,x,y);}function drawArrows(){ctx.strokeStyle='gray';ctx.setLineDash([5,5]);ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(130,200);ctx.lineTo(370,200);ctx.stroke();ctx.setLineDash([]);}addEventListener('mousemove',e=>{const r=c.getBoundingClientRect();const mx=e.clientX-r.left;const my=e.clientY-r.top;for(let i=0;i<states.length;i++){const x=100+i*120;if(Math.abs(mx-x)<30&&Math.abs(my-200)<30){showTooltip(i);break}});function showTooltip(idx){alert(`${states[idx]}\n${['正在创建...','已获得CPU以外的资源','正在CPU上运行','等待I/O完成','已完成生命周期'][idx]}`)}function startDemo(){currentState=(currentState+1)%states.length;draw();}draw();</script></body></html>",
  "description": "通过Canvas绘制五态模型及转换关系，支持鼠标悬停查看状态详情，点击按钮演示状态流转",
  "knowledge_base_quote": [
    "源于教材知识库：《操作系统》进程的基本状态与转换",
    "就绪态是进程已获得除CPU外所有必要资源；执行态是进程正在CPU上运行；阻塞态是进程因等待某事件而暂停"
  ],
  "subtype": "animation"
}